                <head>No. 20</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.–<placeName>Madrid</placeName>,
                        Friday night, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-17">February 17,
                            1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Official service. To Secretary of State, Washington.]</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Thomas Dudley, United States Consul, Liverpool:</hi></p>
                <p>The repairs granted to rebel ram at Ferrol are finished, but she is reported
                    incapable of service. I oppose more work. Her commander starts for Paris Her
                    constructor expected from Bordeaux. Niagara vigilant. Sacramento not
                    arrived.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
